WEBVTT

01:26.400 --> 01:29.680
[Glory]

01:30.670 --> 01:32.940
[Episode 16]

01:36.400 --> 01:37.729
Is it okay to put it here?

01:37.759 --> 01:38.150
Sure.

01:38.280 --> 01:39.479
-Here you are.
-Okay.

01:39.840 --> 01:41.100
Let's leave it at that.

01:43.000 --> 01:44.530
Give it to me. I'll help you.

01:44.920 --> 01:45.840
This looks really good.

01:45.840 --> 01:46.479
Is this okay?

01:46.479 --> 01:46.840
Yes.

01:51.560 --> 01:52.509
These flowers are really beautiful.

01:52.509 --> 01:53.070
Indeed.

01:55.280 --> 01:56.740
Let's move it a bit higher.

01:56.789 --> 01:57.280
-Here.
-How's this?

01:57.280 --> 01:58.880
Replace that one over there.

01:59.120 --> 01:59.920
Lady Shanbao,

02:00.280 --> 02:02.200
every prominent family in town
has sent festival gifts.

02:02.200 --> 02:03.590
Old Madam Rong was in good spirits

02:03.590 --> 02:05.590
and specifically went
to the ceremonial gate to have a look.

02:05.590 --> 02:07.280
Most of the gifts were seasonal fruits,

02:07.280 --> 02:09.400
zongzi, roast goose
and other common items.

02:09.400 --> 02:11.310
The Yang family has sent generous gifts,

02:11.310 --> 02:13.570
and Yang Yitang has such a silver tongue.

02:13.680 --> 02:15.000
Old Madam Rong was so pleased

02:15.000 --> 02:16.870
that she rewarded the carriers
with 500 coins.

02:16.870 --> 02:17.960
She also asked you to set aside

02:17.960 --> 02:19.240
4 boxes of the tea gifts you had prepared

02:19.240 --> 02:20.100
for the capital

02:20.910 --> 02:21.910
and told the kitchen to make

02:21.910 --> 02:22.910
some fresh zongzi

02:23.030 --> 02:23.960
as return gifts.

02:24.990 --> 02:26.079
Old Madam Rong also said

02:26.079 --> 02:26.840
that these reply cards

02:26.840 --> 02:28.650
must be written by you personally,

02:28.650 --> 02:30.780
as a gesture of closeness and respect.

02:42.020 --> 02:43.400
[Gift List]

02:43.960 --> 02:44.890
So you're saying

02:46.010 --> 02:47.010
Grandmother really likes

02:47.010 --> 02:47.970
Yang Yitang?

02:48.460 --> 02:49.060
Well,

02:49.410 --> 02:51.270
I wouldn't dare to say for certain.

02:51.270 --> 02:52.500
Mr. Yang and Mr. Yan

02:52.530 --> 02:54.130
both often visit Chongxi Hall

02:54.130 --> 02:56.060
to join Old Madam Rong
for tea and conversation.

02:56.060 --> 02:57.690
However, Mr. Yang

02:57.690 --> 02:59.240
has brought a cook from his home,

02:59.240 --> 03:00.810
who makes the most amazing goose webs.

03:00.810 --> 03:02.530
Old Madam Rong really likes that dish,

03:02.530 --> 03:04.930
so she often invites Mr. Yang
to have a chat.

03:05.340 --> 03:06.290
Actually,

03:06.660 --> 03:08.340
Mr. Yang does visit more frequently

03:08.340 --> 03:09.180
than Mr. Yan.

03:10.180 --> 03:10.710
I see.

03:28.840 --> 03:29.770
-Mr. Lu.
-Mr. Lu.

03:50.600 --> 03:51.329
You're here.

03:51.790 --> 03:52.320
Yes, I am.

04:20.310 --> 04:21.959
So sour!

04:30.030 --> 04:31.530
Lady Shanbao, you're so busy.

04:31.530 --> 04:33.240
Why not let me write these on your behalf?

04:33.240 --> 04:34.800
You can just oversee my work nearby.

04:34.800 --> 04:35.930
If anything is not to your liking,

04:35.930 --> 04:37.260
I'll rewrite it at once.

04:37.300 --> 04:39.300
This way, nothing else gets held up.

04:39.870 --> 04:40.980
During the festival,

04:40.980 --> 04:42.980
how could you possibly spare the time?

04:42.980 --> 04:45.000
I'll just let Fusheng
write the thank-you notes.

04:45.000 --> 04:46.930
I'd like to take a look
at your handwriting.

04:46.930 --> 04:47.460
Alright.

04:50.200 --> 04:51.400
Bring me the ink and brush.

04:51.400 --> 04:51.870
Yes.

04:58.260 --> 05:00.260
Do you have anything else to report?

05:03.820 --> 05:04.880
I'll take my leave.

06:08.140 --> 06:10.210
Why? Are you reluctant to move in?

06:12.220 --> 06:14.070
Lady Shanbao, thank you for your kindness.

06:14.070 --> 06:15.270
I am truly flattered.

06:16.370 --> 06:18.370
But without an official standing,

06:18.600 --> 06:19.560
my presence here
would invite gossip and criticism.

06:19.560 --> 06:22.050
Sleeping in the main chamber
would feel rather improper.

06:22.050 --> 06:23.260
I'd better move to the side chamber.

06:23.260 --> 06:24.120
Enough of this.

06:25.220 --> 06:26.680
We'll discuss it tonight.

06:28.140 --> 06:28.970
I've taken care

06:28.970 --> 06:30.570
of these three notes myself.

06:31.200 --> 06:33.130
You'll write the rest on my behalf.

06:33.640 --> 06:36.100
Then send them out
after I've reviewed them.

06:50.220 --> 06:51.020
Lady Shanbao,

06:51.140 --> 06:52.700
the tea plantation
has also sent festival gifts.

06:52.700 --> 06:54.560
Yi brought them here personally.

06:54.700 --> 06:57.340
She said that the Gu family
and the Zhao family in Bingzhou

06:57.340 --> 06:58.870
had sent people here again.

06:59.659 --> 07:01.340
These regular clients from Bingzhou

07:01.340 --> 07:03.270
are the most particular about tea,

07:03.320 --> 07:04.850
and they place substantial orders.

07:04.850 --> 07:06.110
I must go and meet them.

07:15.020 --> 07:16.820
You take your time writing here.

07:31.470 --> 07:33.030
We'll discuss it tonight?

07:34.870 --> 07:36.190
Young Master, following your instructions,

07:36.190 --> 07:37.530
apart from the red bean
and candied date zongzi,

07:37.530 --> 07:39.900
the fresh pork and salted egg yolk zongzi,
and the ham zongzi,

07:39.900 --> 07:42.930
we've also prepared
the trendy Five Blessings Zongzi,

07:42.930 --> 07:45.510
for the auspicious omen
of five blessings coming home.

07:45.510 --> 07:47.710
Lady Shanbao will surely be delighted.

07:56.030 --> 07:56.830
Interesting!

08:02.330 --> 08:02.830
Send them over.

08:02.830 --> 08:03.360
Alright.

08:04.720 --> 08:05.050
Wait.

08:06.390 --> 08:08.830
I'd better deliver them

08:08.990 --> 08:10.390
to Shanbao myself later.

08:10.390 --> 08:10.830
Okay.

08:11.530 --> 08:12.140
Mr. Wen,

08:12.440 --> 08:13.900
Mr. Yang is here to see you.

08:22.690 --> 08:23.420
Mr. Wen.

08:27.230 --> 08:28.490
I've come at a bad time.

08:28.670 --> 08:29.870
Sorry to disturb you.

08:34.460 --> 08:36.460
Mr. Yang, what brings you here?

08:37.070 --> 08:38.450
I specifically prepared some small gifts

08:38.450 --> 08:39.450
to thank Mr. Lu,

08:39.830 --> 08:41.230
but he wasn't in his room.

08:41.280 --> 08:42.669
I asked a servant and learned

08:42.669 --> 08:43.330
that early this morning,

08:43.330 --> 08:45.190
he had moved to Hualin Courtyard.

08:52.790 --> 08:54.050
During this festival,

08:54.320 --> 08:55.920
everyone is extremely busy.

08:56.610 --> 08:57.430
Shanbao

08:58.050 --> 08:59.850
is in dire need of help right now.

09:06.660 --> 09:08.300
It's awkward to discuss it with outsiders.

09:08.300 --> 09:10.010
But Mr. Wen, you're considered
a member of the Rong family,

09:10.010 --> 09:11.940
so there is no need for discretion here.

09:11.940 --> 09:13.940
I've heard that when the women
of the Rong Family choose their husbands,

09:13.940 --> 09:15.630
they follow an old custom
of trial marriage.

09:15.630 --> 09:17.110
If the couple pass
the initial month harmoniously,

09:17.110 --> 09:19.040
finding affection and happiness together,

09:19.040 --> 09:20.790
then the marriage is set in stone

09:20.790 --> 09:22.140
and can't be easily undone.

09:22.140 --> 09:23.670
If they're not compatible,

09:24.480 --> 09:25.830
then the young man

09:25.850 --> 09:27.930
will be respectfully sent away
with generous gifts.

09:27.930 --> 09:29.450
And the marriage will be called off.

09:29.450 --> 09:32.410
Both parties are free to marry others,
with no further ties or obligations.

09:32.410 --> 09:34.740
I thought Mr. Lu was there
for such a trial.

09:37.990 --> 09:39.510
But it seems I was overthinking.

09:39.510 --> 09:40.770
I'll send someone to deliver these gifts

09:40.770 --> 09:41.970
to Hualin Courtyard.

09:41.980 --> 09:43.740
I'll come to visit you another day.

09:43.740 --> 09:45.410
Take care.

09:55.350 --> 09:59.870
One, two, three.

10:06.070 --> 10:08.200
Young Master, you made this yourself!

10:08.540 --> 10:09.400
It's dirty now.

10:09.730 --> 10:11.460
She doesn't care for it anyway.

10:11.490 --> 10:13.910
Bringing it to her
would just be asking for humiliation.

10:13.910 --> 10:14.910
She clearly knows

10:15.220 --> 10:17.630
he's a troublemaker who brings misfortune.

10:17.630 --> 10:18.800
Yet, just because he can talk his way

10:18.800 --> 10:19.600
out of things,

10:19.670 --> 10:21.530
she insists on keeping him close.

10:22.240 --> 10:23.640
She'll learn the hard way

10:24.460 --> 10:26.660
Only then will she realize how good I am.

10:27.340 --> 10:28.140
Young Master.

10:29.250 --> 10:30.050
Young Master.

10:30.890 --> 10:32.010
Yang Yitang

10:32.640 --> 10:34.180
must be harboring ill intentions.

10:34.180 --> 10:35.040
Think about it.

10:35.410 --> 10:36.210
Lady Shanbao

10:36.260 --> 10:37.760
holds such vast family fortunes
in her hands.

10:37.760 --> 10:38.640
Everyone

10:38.840 --> 10:40.770
scrambles to curry favor with her!

10:40.910 --> 10:42.700
If you really storm over
to Hualin Courtyard

10:42.700 --> 10:43.420
and get

10:43.440 --> 10:45.240
into a heated argument with her,

10:46.360 --> 10:47.890
that will ruin everything.

10:48.820 --> 10:49.620
Young Master.

10:50.040 --> 10:52.400
A century-old tree root
can never be completely severed.

10:52.400 --> 10:54.560
A bond forged over years can't be fake.

10:57.180 --> 10:59.130
Young Master,
as long as you remain patient,

10:59.130 --> 11:01.530
Lady Shanbao will come around eventually.

11:08.160 --> 11:08.700
He is actually

11:08.700 --> 11:11.300
better at stirring up trouble
than his cousin.

11:12.050 --> 11:13.310
Before Old Madam Rong,

11:13.940 --> 11:15.060
he has pushed Yan Bailou

11:15.060 --> 11:16.790
completely out of the picture.

11:18.300 --> 11:20.160
None of them are easy to deal with.

11:23.330 --> 11:25.260
Right now, Lu Fusheng

11:25.800 --> 11:27.600
has indeed won Shanbao's favor.

11:28.330 --> 11:30.850
But things have reached

11:32.300 --> 11:33.610
a fever pitch.

11:34.370 --> 11:36.230
What good can possibly come of it?

11:39.300 --> 11:40.180
I'm afraid

11:41.320 --> 11:44.240
that disaster is just around the corner.

11:46.160 --> 11:48.820
Let's see
how much longer he can swagger around.

12:28.870 --> 12:29.890
Some of the Rong family's treasures

12:29.890 --> 12:31.890
are hidden right here in my chamber.

12:32.240 --> 12:35.040
Turn the base of that lamp
three times to the right,

12:35.250 --> 12:37.510
and you'll know if I'm telling the truth.

12:37.720 --> 12:38.810
What if what's hidden in the tunnel

12:38.810 --> 12:39.980
isn't treasure,

12:40.910 --> 12:42.040
but a living person?

13:27.310 --> 13:28.810
Watch him closely yourself

13:28.810 --> 13:30.470
and see if he is truly unmoved.

13:30.830 --> 13:31.240
Yes.

13:51.540 --> 13:52.600
Where are we going?

13:52.670 --> 13:53.220
Jun Dai!

13:53.390 --> 13:54.790
Where are they taking me?

13:55.190 --> 13:55.650
Jun Dai!

14:03.970 --> 14:06.830
Young Master,
is the water temperature just right?

14:07.460 --> 14:09.190
The water temperature is fine,

14:09.780 --> 14:11.990
but I just bathed yesterday.

14:12.530 --> 14:14.120
I don't think this is necessary.

14:14.120 --> 14:14.780
Don't move!

14:38.500 --> 14:39.500
Jasmine?

14:41.580 --> 14:43.510
And it even has musk in it.

14:44.770 --> 14:46.570
This is really too extravagant.

14:46.710 --> 14:47.880
Mr. Yan and Mr. Wen

14:47.900 --> 14:48.500
both spend

14:48.530 --> 14:49.800
hours bathing each time.

14:49.800 --> 14:51.580
Their inner robes are also scented.

14:51.580 --> 14:53.540
That's the style of a gentleman
from a noble family.

14:53.540 --> 14:54.490
A little floral perfume and musk on you

14:54.490 --> 14:55.670
is nothing in comparison.

14:55.670 --> 14:57.020
Why weren't Yang Dingchen

14:57.020 --> 14:57.880
and He Xingming

14:57.890 --> 14:59.100
popular with ladies?

14:59.830 --> 15:00.940
Because they swung swords and clubs
all day,

15:00.940 --> 15:02.200
reeking of sour sweat.

15:02.250 --> 15:03.300
When they approached the ladies,

15:03.300 --> 15:05.130
they drove everyone away
with their stench.

15:05.130 --> 15:07.130
Such coarse men are despised by all.

15:07.350 --> 15:10.210
Young Master,
you must never follow their example.

15:28.450 --> 15:30.350
Young Master, the mole on your chest
is an auspicious sign,

15:30.350 --> 15:32.560
foretelling a thriving family
and a bright future.

15:32.560 --> 15:33.440
It's an exceedingly fortunate...

15:33.440 --> 15:34.230
Shut up.

15:35.340 --> 15:36.740
All of you, wait outside.

15:38.090 --> 15:39.150
I'll bathe myself.

15:40.410 --> 15:40.940
Let's go.

15:43.390 --> 15:45.500
Young Master, I'll take my leave.

16:16.400 --> 16:17.110
No, no, no.

16:17.470 --> 16:18.960
How dare I disturb Lady Shanbao?

16:18.960 --> 16:21.300
I think that my side chamber
is perfectly fine.

16:21.300 --> 16:22.230
You've had a tiring day, Young Master.

16:22.230 --> 16:24.090
It's better for you to rest early.

16:25.800 --> 16:27.730
My side chamber is perfectly fine.

16:44.350 --> 16:45.680
It's already very late.

16:46.750 --> 16:47.630
Do you intend

16:47.630 --> 16:49.230
to sit alone there all night?

16:50.420 --> 16:52.080
If I were to share a bed with you

16:52.150 --> 16:53.550
and become your husband,

16:53.650 --> 16:55.250
when you learn the truth
about why I came here,

16:55.250 --> 16:57.180
you would definitely hate my guts.

16:57.600 --> 16:58.120
No.

16:58.870 --> 17:00.180
This must not happen.

17:01.030 --> 17:02.160
You don't come over.

17:02.990 --> 17:04.190
Are you expecting me to go over

17:04.190 --> 17:05.450
and invite you myself?

17:14.680 --> 17:15.410
Lu Jianglai,

17:15.970 --> 17:17.500
you must control yourself.

17:23.290 --> 17:24.750
I already said everything

17:25.250 --> 17:26.650
I needed to say last time.

17:27.780 --> 17:29.230
Lady Shanbao, please show me mercy.

17:29.230 --> 17:31.690
Don't make things difficult
for me anymore.

17:33.510 --> 17:35.060
Xiu Qiong is so careless.

17:35.780 --> 17:37.040
When she was mending clothes,

17:37.040 --> 17:39.340
she casually stuck the needle in her cuff.

17:39.340 --> 17:40.140
When she was making my bed,

17:40.140 --> 17:41.430
it fell onto my bed.

17:42.210 --> 17:44.470
I've felt around but still can't find it.

17:45.060 --> 17:46.100
Bring me a candle.

17:47.030 --> 17:48.360
I'll search carefully.

17:50.050 --> 17:50.650
All right.

18:07.870 --> 18:08.900
Here's the candle.

18:08.900 --> 18:09.630
Come closer.

18:14.950 --> 18:17.150
Even closer. I still can't see clearly.

18:41.750 --> 18:42.750
Have you found it?

18:43.270 --> 18:44.130
A little lower.

18:54.190 --> 18:54.920
Lower still.

19:00.230 --> 19:01.750
I... I...

19:02.700 --> 19:04.760
I'd better just leave it here for you.

19:05.620 --> 19:07.540
Lady Shanbao,
take your time looking for it.

19:07.540 --> 19:09.910
Come over. Is this it?

19:22.580 --> 19:24.780
You might as well come inside to search.

19:39.330 --> 19:40.950
Do not look at what is improper.

19:40.950 --> 19:42.290
It only taints one's discerning gaze.

19:42.290 --> 19:43.910
Do not listen to what is improper.

19:43.910 --> 19:45.710
It only disturbs one's inner peace.

19:45.710 --> 19:46.970
What are you reciting?

19:47.530 --> 19:49.670
Do not speak improperly.
It definitely brings disgrace.

19:49.670 --> 19:52.870
Do not act improperly.
It definitely brings misfortune.

19:54.100 --> 19:55.420
Do not look at what is improper...

19:55.420 --> 19:56.750
I asked you to come here,

19:57.840 --> 20:00.100
only for fear that others might harm you.

20:00.370 --> 20:02.300
About the mechanism in my chamber,

20:02.670 --> 20:04.730
a twist to the right will claim a life,

20:04.820 --> 20:07.230
but a twist to the left can save a life.

20:08.470 --> 20:10.470
You might need it in times of danger.

20:12.030 --> 20:13.690
Lady Shanbao, you're willing

20:15.860 --> 20:17.390
to tell me such a big secret?

20:23.540 --> 20:25.670
With the family's future on my shoulders,

20:25.670 --> 20:27.730
I must think carefully at every turn.

20:27.780 --> 20:29.440
I deliberately kept you here.

20:29.510 --> 20:30.510
It was to test you.

20:31.350 --> 20:33.150
I hope you will not take offense.

20:33.250 --> 20:34.980
Now, with all doubts dispelled

20:35.030 --> 20:36.230
and all grudges gone,

20:37.230 --> 20:40.670
I only hope that from now on,
our hearts will beat as one,

20:41.780 --> 20:43.910
and no suspicion will come between us.

20:48.400 --> 20:49.050
You...

21:09.140 --> 21:11.200
It's good that we've cleared the air.

21:11.200 --> 21:13.460
Tomorrow I'll have someone
prepare a bed for you.

21:13.460 --> 21:14.700
Tonight, I'm afraid

21:15.090 --> 21:17.150
you'll have to make do with the floor.

21:47.610 --> 21:48.670
By the way, Lady Shanbao,

21:48.670 --> 21:49.750
have you found that needle?

21:49.750 --> 21:51.610
It will be terrible if you get hurt.

21:51.610 --> 21:52.710
Let me help you look for it.

21:52.710 --> 21:53.510
I've found it.

21:54.510 --> 21:55.110
Sleep now.

21:56.480 --> 21:57.210
That's good.

22:20.190 --> 22:20.990
Young Master.

22:21.430 --> 22:22.710
They say the wedding night

22:22.710 --> 22:23.710
is a small triumph in life.

22:23.710 --> 22:24.470
It's such a happy occasion.

22:24.470 --> 22:25.490
Why the long face?

22:25.980 --> 22:27.040
It's frightening.

22:36.540 --> 22:37.580
What have you found?

22:37.580 --> 22:39.380
I've made inquiries all around.

22:39.380 --> 22:40.270
All the serving women

22:40.270 --> 22:41.100
in Hualin Courtyard

22:41.100 --> 22:42.990
hold signed contracts
and have family ties here.

22:42.990 --> 22:44.060
Each family has over ten members,

22:44.060 --> 22:45.780
with three generations
serving the Rong family.

22:45.780 --> 22:47.990
None of them match the profile
of Madam Yang.

22:47.990 --> 22:49.430
But don't worry, Young Master.

22:49.430 --> 22:50.750
Even if she's not with Lady Shanbao,

22:50.750 --> 22:52.340
she could well be in another courtyard.

22:52.340 --> 22:53.580
I will personally check

22:53.580 --> 22:55.190
every woman in the Rong Mansion

22:55.190 --> 22:56.120
who fits the age.

22:56.750 --> 22:57.190
That Madam Yang

22:57.190 --> 22:59.380
is probably no longer
in the Rong Mansion.

22:59.380 --> 23:01.510
How could you know that, Young Master?

23:01.580 --> 23:03.470
Lang Zhusheng has already searched
every inch of the Rong Mansion

23:03.470 --> 23:05.580
under the pretext of gathering evidence.

23:05.580 --> 23:06.510
He didn't find any woman

23:06.510 --> 23:08.310
matching Madam Yang's profile.

23:08.340 --> 23:09.620
Even if Madam Yang had been here,

23:09.620 --> 23:10.980
with such a huge commotion,

23:10.980 --> 23:13.110
we would have inevitably alerted her.

23:14.140 --> 23:16.020
I was planning to wait
until things calmed down

23:16.020 --> 23:17.780
and then seek another chance
to investigate.

23:17.780 --> 23:19.510
But now that I've moved into...

23:21.100 --> 23:24.100
Hualin Courtyard is quite nice.

23:27.020 --> 23:28.780
Now that I've moved into Hualin Courtyard,

23:28.780 --> 23:29.430
every move I make

23:29.430 --> 23:30.830
is under constant watch,

23:30.960 --> 23:32.540
which makes things difficult.

23:32.540 --> 23:35.060
Should I...

23:36.650 --> 23:37.670
You little traitor,

23:37.670 --> 23:39.130
you were exposed long ago.

23:40.390 --> 23:41.990
You'd better lie low for now.

23:42.140 --> 23:44.070
Otherwise I'll have to rescue you.

23:47.060 --> 23:48.290
Haste makes waste.

23:48.930 --> 23:50.530
If we want to find Madam Yang,

23:50.580 --> 23:52.640
the key still lies with Lady Shanbao.

23:56.300 --> 23:58.270
Rong Shanbao
keeps a very tight lid on things.

23:58.270 --> 24:00.030
I need to carefully follow the clues

24:00.030 --> 24:01.230
and find Madam Yang.

24:02.300 --> 24:02.830
Let's go!

24:03.990 --> 24:04.750
Young Master,

24:04.750 --> 24:05.990
where are we going now?

24:05.990 --> 24:06.830
Prepare the carriage.

24:06.830 --> 24:07.760
I'm going to deliver the return gifts.

24:07.760 --> 24:11.670
[Hualin Courtyard]

24:30.780 --> 24:31.580
Mr. Lu has always

24:31.580 --> 24:33.100
preferred to keep a low profile.

24:33.100 --> 24:35.030
Who is he putting on such a show for?

24:35.580 --> 24:36.540
How odd.

24:36.670 --> 24:38.230
This young master has such elegant manners

24:38.230 --> 24:39.100
and noble bearing.

24:39.100 --> 24:40.030
How impressive.

24:40.140 --> 24:41.100
Which family is he from?

24:41.100 --> 24:42.430
He must be

24:42.430 --> 24:43.830
from a prominent family.

24:49.190 --> 24:49.650
My Lord.

24:49.910 --> 24:50.990
This is your treasured possession.

24:50.990 --> 24:53.190
Please don't let it fall into the water.

24:59.650 --> 25:01.650
Go. Hurry and find out

25:02.380 --> 25:03.910
who that leading person is.

25:04.730 --> 25:05.460
Yes, My Lord.

25:06.650 --> 25:09.220
[Linji Prefectural Office]

25:08.290 --> 25:09.470
Hurry and inform Lord Prefect!

25:09.470 --> 25:10.860
I have urgent business
and must see him at once!

25:10.860 --> 25:11.670
Lord Prefect is receiving a guest.

25:11.670 --> 25:13.100
Clerk Qing, please wait in the back
and have some tea.

25:13.100 --> 25:13.580
That's right.

25:13.580 --> 25:15.140
It's an extremely urgent matter.

25:15.140 --> 25:16.430
Not a moment can be wasted!

25:16.430 --> 25:17.580
Who exactly is inside?

25:17.580 --> 25:18.840
It's Magistrate Lang.

25:18.930 --> 25:19.930
Magistrate Lang?

25:20.060 --> 25:21.520
I was just looking for him.

25:21.580 --> 25:22.230
Perfect timing!

25:22.230 --> 25:22.890
Clerk Qing!

25:23.820 --> 25:25.820
That's truly an all-around kitchen talent.

25:25.820 --> 25:27.230
With all the guests coming and going
at your residence,

25:27.230 --> 25:29.230
he's more than capable
of preparing a feast.

25:29.230 --> 25:30.620
He's also good at making the hometown tofu

25:30.620 --> 25:31.550
Old Madam loves.

25:31.860 --> 25:33.510
The tofu is simmered in old duck broth

25:33.510 --> 25:35.380
and then finished
with a fine sprinkle of minced ham.

25:35.380 --> 25:37.510
The aroma alone could carry for miles.

25:39.080 --> 25:41.880
Old Madam is dissatisfied
with the kitchen staff.

25:42.720 --> 25:44.540
We've searched throughout Linji

25:44.540 --> 25:46.060
but still couldn't find anyone
to her liking.

25:46.060 --> 25:48.230
You've thought of everything
so meticulously.

25:48.230 --> 25:49.230
It tastes amazing

25:49.990 --> 25:51.060
and looks perfect.

25:52.270 --> 25:52.730
My Lord.

25:54.750 --> 25:56.630
Do not trust this honey-tongued man

25:56.630 --> 25:58.490
who is treacherous and disloyal!

25:58.710 --> 25:59.440
How dare you!

26:00.340 --> 26:01.940
In front of Magistrate Lang,

26:02.100 --> 26:03.990
how dare you speak so recklessly!

26:04.150 --> 26:04.610
My Lord,

26:04.910 --> 26:06.130
I swear I'm utterly loyal

26:06.130 --> 26:06.850
to you.

26:07.430 --> 26:08.830
Without solid evidence,

26:09.060 --> 26:10.860
I wouldn't dare to make false accusations.

26:10.860 --> 26:12.280
Just now,
as I went to fetch the painting for you,

26:12.280 --> 26:13.620
I ran into an acquaintance on the street.

26:13.620 --> 26:15.150
It nearly stopped my heart.

26:15.470 --> 26:17.130
Do you know who it was, My Lord?

26:17.470 --> 26:18.670
It was the Imperial Inspector
from the capital,

26:18.670 --> 26:19.400
Lu Jianglai.

26:19.750 --> 26:20.550
He's not dead!

26:21.340 --> 26:22.750
After making some inquiries,

26:22.750 --> 26:23.340
I've learned that he is

26:23.340 --> 26:24.640
the Rong family's future son-in-law,

26:24.640 --> 26:26.430
basking in all their glory and favor.

26:26.430 --> 26:28.480
When the Yang family's young master died,

26:28.480 --> 26:31.140
Magistrate Lang personally went
to the Rong Mansion to investigate.

26:31.140 --> 26:33.540
He must have met his old colleague
face to face then.

26:33.540 --> 26:34.430
But he remained silent,

26:34.430 --> 26:36.030
hiding the news completely.

26:36.060 --> 26:37.790
Can he deny his ill intentions?

26:45.060 --> 26:47.460
No wonder you're stuck
as a petty official.

26:47.820 --> 26:49.510
All you're good at is sowing discord

26:49.510 --> 26:51.710
and turning people against each other.

26:52.510 --> 26:55.230
You lack Mr. Lang's meticulous thought

26:55.430 --> 26:56.690
and long-term vision.

26:57.800 --> 26:58.840
He is ignorant.

26:59.860 --> 27:01.390
Please don't take offense.

27:01.620 --> 27:03.680
I don't deserve such praise, My Lord.

27:03.750 --> 27:05.470
Clerk Qing's direct admonition

27:05.470 --> 27:06.670
shows clearly his utter loyalty

27:06.670 --> 27:08.130
and unwavering devotion.

27:08.190 --> 27:09.580
My Lord, he's truly worthy
of the repeated promotions

27:09.580 --> 27:11.340
and trust you've bestowed upon him.

27:11.340 --> 27:13.070
Clerk Qing, you worry too much.

27:13.620 --> 27:15.950
I've already reported this matter
to Lord Prefect.

27:15.950 --> 27:18.190
It's said
this man suffered severe head injuries,

27:18.190 --> 27:19.720
becoming completely dull.

27:19.750 --> 27:21.810
He didn't even recognize me anymore.

27:21.820 --> 27:23.710
I originally planned
to eliminate this potential threat,

27:23.710 --> 27:25.170
whether it was true or not.

27:25.540 --> 27:27.190
But he's under the protection
of the Rong family now.

27:27.190 --> 27:29.140
It's not easy to make a move against him
for the time being.

27:29.140 --> 27:29.600
My Lord,

27:30.270 --> 27:31.270
to end this trouble for good,

27:31.270 --> 27:32.780
we must deal with the source.

27:32.780 --> 27:34.470
We absolutely can't let him live!

27:34.470 --> 27:36.580
Lord Lu, the Imperial Inspector
from the capital,

27:36.580 --> 27:38.670
has already turned to dust and ashes.

27:39.840 --> 27:41.120
Dead men tell no tales.

27:42.100 --> 27:44.510
Even if the man from the Rong Mansion

27:44.510 --> 27:46.440
parades around official circles,

27:46.480 --> 27:47.930
I say he is an impostor,

27:48.340 --> 27:49.300
and so he is.

27:50.060 --> 27:51.540
We can convict him

27:51.540 --> 27:54.060
of impersonating the Imperial Inspector,

27:55.190 --> 27:55.860
take him out

27:57.290 --> 27:59.380
and carry out the execution.

28:02.100 --> 28:02.510
But...

28:02.820 --> 28:05.680
The Rong family has dominated Linji
for centuries.

28:06.300 --> 28:09.310
Even the Provincial Governor
treads carefully around them.

28:09.310 --> 28:10.770
We cannot act recklessly.

28:12.990 --> 28:13.750
Zhusheng.

28:14.750 --> 28:15.800
That Ding-ware white-glazed flower vase

28:15.800 --> 28:18.410
you presented was an excellent choice.

28:18.710 --> 28:20.950
The Provincial Governor was quite pleased
with it.

28:20.950 --> 28:21.780
We still need

28:21.780 --> 28:23.380
to secure its matching pair.

28:23.910 --> 28:25.270
No need to trouble yourself
over this, My Lord.

28:25.270 --> 28:27.600
I've already sent people
to search for it.

28:34.190 --> 28:35.450
I'll take my leave now.

28:51.750 --> 28:52.780
Fool!

28:53.820 --> 28:55.350
You're a damn loose cannon.

28:55.750 --> 28:56.950
What use are you to me?

28:56.960 --> 28:58.100
My Lord, I'm truly sorry.

28:58.100 --> 28:59.500
I deserve to be punished.

29:00.250 --> 29:01.140
Enough.

29:02.500 --> 29:03.990
I know you're loyal to me.

29:04.700 --> 29:06.100
You've made a good point.

29:06.670 --> 29:09.270
Keeping him alive
will eventually bring disaster.

29:09.270 --> 29:11.600
He must be eliminated as soon as possible.

29:11.860 --> 29:12.860
What's your plan?

29:14.780 --> 29:15.240
My Lord.

29:16.230 --> 29:16.950
Why not...

29:23.140 --> 29:25.210
[Rong Mansion]

29:38.930 --> 29:39.590
Watch this!

29:45.520 --> 29:46.120
Take this!

30:05.510 --> 30:07.270
She is your own blood sister.

30:07.540 --> 30:09.540
She indeed scolded you a little harshly,
but it's not a big deal.

30:09.540 --> 30:11.770
Are you truly going
to hold a grudge against her?

30:11.770 --> 30:14.200
There are no lasting resentments
between sisters.

30:14.200 --> 30:17.860
If this gets out, people will laugh at you
for being petty-minded.

30:19.540 --> 30:20.140
Look,

30:20.980 --> 30:22.400
she's urging Yunyin

30:22.910 --> 30:23.750
to apologize to you

30:23.750 --> 30:25.150
in front of Grandmother.

30:25.510 --> 30:26.820
If you don't accept the apology,

30:26.820 --> 30:28.300
it'll make you look ungenerous,

30:28.300 --> 30:29.860
unwilling to forgive your sister.

30:29.860 --> 30:30.860
Since childhood,

30:30.910 --> 30:32.940
she has been playing the same old tricks.

30:32.940 --> 30:33.400
Come on.

30:40.980 --> 30:41.860
Hurry up and go.

30:56.430 --> 30:58.360
Today is the Dragon Boat Festival.

30:58.430 --> 31:01.860
Our whole family has gathered here
to celebrate this festival.

31:01.860 --> 31:03.870
With this cup of wine
offered by Grandmother,

31:03.870 --> 31:05.710
I offer my sincerest apology to you.

31:05.710 --> 31:07.620
Shanbao, with your great magnanimity,

31:07.620 --> 31:09.750
please don't hold a grudge against me
over the matter

31:09.750 --> 31:10.480
with Yunwan.

31:11.860 --> 31:13.470
These days, you have been upset with her,

31:13.470 --> 31:14.540
refusing to see her.

31:14.540 --> 31:15.780
She was frightened,

31:15.780 --> 31:17.580
filled with nothing but regret.

31:17.990 --> 31:19.950
But she was too stubborn
to swallow her pride and apologize.

31:19.950 --> 31:22.100
Grandmother always says
that sisters within our family

31:22.100 --> 31:24.580
are bound by the deepest love
and shared blood.

31:24.580 --> 31:26.630
Nothing can truly sever
the connection between us.

31:26.630 --> 31:28.160
Just drink this cup of wine,

31:28.190 --> 31:28.860
and we'll still be

31:28.860 --> 31:30.190
loving sisters.

31:30.620 --> 31:31.620
As for what happened in the past,

31:31.620 --> 31:33.280
let's never speak of it again.

31:43.300 --> 31:44.230
Please sit down.

31:57.750 --> 31:59.710
That's what I call magnanimity,

32:00.230 --> 32:02.290
the kind of quality a true leader has.

32:02.460 --> 32:03.540
Didn't I say so?

32:04.060 --> 32:04.690
Lady Shanbao...

32:04.690 --> 32:07.150
Yunyin, I haven't had a game with you
in ages.

32:07.190 --> 32:08.790
Let's stick to the old rules.

32:08.860 --> 32:10.750
One cup per loss.

32:11.140 --> 32:12.000
What do you say?

32:13.060 --> 32:13.660
You're on!

33:29.100 --> 33:29.900
Lady Shanbao,

33:30.270 --> 33:31.300
it's just for fun.

33:31.710 --> 33:33.440
No need to take it so seriously.

33:34.110 --> 33:35.910
A bet is all about wins and losses.

33:35.910 --> 33:37.780
If you can't afford to lose,
then don't join in the game at all,

33:37.780 --> 33:39.640
lest you become a laughingstock.

33:39.670 --> 33:41.730
It seems that Yunyin can't continue.

33:41.910 --> 33:43.770
Yunxi, you should take her place.

33:45.510 --> 33:46.230
Well...

33:46.950 --> 33:48.350
Yun'e was right earlier.

33:48.820 --> 33:50.220
On such a grand festival,

33:50.300 --> 33:52.060
it's so nice that we finally have time

33:52.060 --> 33:53.580
to relax and play together.

33:53.580 --> 33:55.510
What a perfect picture of harmony and joy.

33:55.510 --> 33:56.340
Grandmother will be

33:56.340 --> 33:57.700
over the moon to see us like this.

33:57.700 --> 33:59.560
No one is allowed to spoil the fun.

34:00.030 --> 34:00.910
Exactly.

34:01.430 --> 34:03.290
No one is allowed to spoil the fun.

34:11.409 --> 34:13.429
The tiny cup
is barely enough for one sip.

34:13.429 --> 34:14.230
I've decided.

34:14.510 --> 34:15.710
Bring the large cups!

34:19.389 --> 34:19.949
Please.

34:33.830 --> 34:35.290
A wonderful performance,

34:35.909 --> 34:37.510
both in playing and singing.

34:37.870 --> 34:38.600
Reward them.

34:39.340 --> 34:39.940
Yes.

34:41.489 --> 34:43.580
I have no relatives or friends in Linji.

34:43.580 --> 34:45.440
Who could possibly want to see me?

34:46.219 --> 34:47.179
Just go ahead.

34:47.580 --> 34:49.260
You'll find that out soon enough.

34:49.260 --> 34:50.060
They're here!

34:51.219 --> 34:53.790
His illegitimate children
have come calling.

34:53.790 --> 34:55.310
Now the real drama begins.

35:00.080 --> 35:00.540
This...

35:01.620 --> 35:02.060
You...

35:02.260 --> 35:05.740
-Father!
-Father!

35:06.100 --> 35:08.620
-Father!
-Father!

35:08.620 --> 35:09.510
-Father!
-Father!

35:09.510 --> 35:11.180
What a shameless wretch!

35:11.350 --> 35:12.220
How could he do such a thing?

35:12.220 --> 35:14.180
My dear, thank heavens.

35:14.700 --> 35:16.390
We've finally found you.

35:16.830 --> 35:18.510
-Father!
-Father!

35:19.660 --> 35:20.220
My dear.

35:21.060 --> 35:22.700
My dear, it's me!

35:22.700 --> 35:24.580
-Father!
-Father!

35:24.830 --> 35:25.390
Father!

35:25.740 --> 35:26.700
-Let go of me!
-Father!

35:26.700 --> 35:27.430
I'm not your father!

35:27.430 --> 35:28.830
-Father!
-You must have been mistaken!

35:28.830 --> 35:30.180
-Father!
-Let go of me!

35:30.310 --> 35:32.100
-Father!
-Father!

35:32.130 --> 35:33.060
What's going on?

35:41.190 --> 35:43.960
It's not a good idea
to drink too much realgar wine.

35:41.360 --> 35:45.620
[Realgar wine is toxic.
Do not attempt this in real life.]

35:44.360 --> 35:45.960
Too much of it makes me dizzy.

35:46.040 --> 35:48.040
I'll let the sisters have their fun.

35:48.470 --> 35:48.910
Come,

35:49.620 --> 35:51.790
walk with me in the garden.

36:06.480 --> 36:08.410
All the past grievances and wrongs

36:08.660 --> 36:10.390
were stirred up by outsiders.

36:10.820 --> 36:13.050
That He fellow spread gossip

36:13.320 --> 36:14.380
and sowed discord,

36:14.780 --> 36:16.300
causing Yunwan's death

36:16.980 --> 36:19.180
and even tearing our sisterhood apart.

36:19.290 --> 36:21.350
You have every right to hold a grudge.

36:21.580 --> 36:22.350
Back then,

36:22.660 --> 36:24.460
the family fortunes
built by our Rong ancestors

36:24.460 --> 36:26.190
were also ruined by outsiders.

36:26.310 --> 36:28.790
We should learn from the past

36:29.220 --> 36:31.140
and remain vigilant at all times.

36:38.390 --> 36:41.310
Today, regardless of who's right or wrong,

36:41.660 --> 36:45.260
I shall drink three bowls of wine
to offer you my sincere apology.

37:35.660 --> 37:37.660
I have long known all your thoughts.

37:37.910 --> 37:40.170
I simply chose not to expose them before.

37:40.180 --> 37:42.310
If we must discuss why a kingdom fell,

37:42.700 --> 37:43.680
it was the two queens

37:43.680 --> 37:45.240
who were at each other's throats,

37:45.240 --> 37:46.710
which gave outsiders an opening

37:46.710 --> 37:47.880
to seize the realm.

37:48.580 --> 37:49.620
If we sisters continue

37:49.620 --> 37:52.180
to be at odds like this,
pulling in different directions,

37:52.180 --> 37:53.510
our family fortunes

37:53.910 --> 37:55.390
will not endure for long.

37:56.030 --> 37:58.200
In the past,
for the sake of our shared blood,

37:58.200 --> 38:00.060
I never took such things to heart.

38:00.180 --> 38:02.470
But after what happened with Yunwan,
I've learned

38:02.470 --> 38:05.200
that indulgence only nurtures
future calamity.

38:05.910 --> 38:08.020
From now on,
if anyone dares to step out of line again,

38:08.020 --> 38:09.700
I will enforce the family law first

38:09.700 --> 38:11.900
before any talk of sisterly affection.

38:17.540 --> 38:19.230
We sisters share the same family roots.

38:19.230 --> 38:20.470
We should be of one mind
in safeguarding our family legacy,

38:20.470 --> 38:21.870
as one inseparable body.

38:22.030 --> 38:23.830
No one gets to run the whole show.

38:32.110 --> 38:33.110
What's going on?

38:37.350 --> 38:39.610
My Lady, there's a commotion at the gate.

38:41.820 --> 38:44.350
Looks like there's quite a show
going on at the gate.

38:44.350 --> 38:46.150
Come on, let's go and have a look.

38:57.270 --> 38:59.200
Lady Shanbao, they're just ahead.

39:00.620 --> 39:02.660
Father,

39:03.390 --> 39:04.790
I've missed you!

39:04.790 --> 39:05.390
Lady Shanbao.

39:05.390 --> 39:06.140
What's happening?

39:06.140 --> 39:07.140
I truly do not know any of you.

39:07.140 --> 39:07.690
Lady Shanbao.

39:07.690 --> 39:08.310
Let go of me!

39:08.310 --> 39:09.140
Today, a woman

39:09.140 --> 39:10.350
came to the gate with her children,

39:10.350 --> 39:11.950
making a scene in the street.

39:12.540 --> 39:16.030
She claimed to be Mr. Lu‘s wife
from his hometown.

39:16.350 --> 39:17.550
Stop calling me that!

39:18.780 --> 39:19.840
Lady Rong Shanbao.

39:20.740 --> 39:21.540
Lady Shanbao.

39:21.900 --> 39:23.870
-Young Master, this...
-Lady Rong Shanbao.

39:23.870 --> 39:25.400
You're from a noble family,

39:25.430 --> 39:27.160
with both power and influence.

39:27.330 --> 39:28.120
Please

39:28.150 --> 39:30.480
don't strip me of my husband.

39:31.350 --> 39:33.180
If you take him away from me,

39:33.950 --> 39:36.660
I'll be completely hopeless in this life.

39:36.790 --> 39:38.060
I might as well take my children

39:38.060 --> 39:39.860
and drown ourselves in the lake.

39:40.950 --> 39:41.580
This is such a humiliation

39:41.580 --> 39:42.870
for Lady Rong Shanbao!

39:42.870 --> 39:43.860
Don't listen to her nonsense!

39:43.860 --> 39:44.740
This is all a misunderstanding!

39:44.740 --> 39:45.470
This is a complete disgrace

39:45.470 --> 39:46.100
for the Rong family.

39:46.100 --> 39:47.350
Stop making a scene here

39:47.350 --> 39:48.510
and ruining my reputation.

39:48.510 --> 39:49.710
I don't even know you!

39:50.350 --> 39:52.140
Lady Shanbao, it was entirely my fault.

39:52.140 --> 39:54.260
I should have taken her to the mansion
for questioning.

39:54.260 --> 39:55.420
There are too many onlookers here.

39:55.420 --> 39:56.840
This farce has gone too far.

39:56.840 --> 39:58.640
Even if we were to tie them up now,

39:59.290 --> 40:01.420
it would be hard to silence the gossip.

40:01.960 --> 40:03.070
That's true.

40:04.830 --> 40:07.060
It is better
to settle this matter right here.

40:07.060 --> 40:08.600
Those disreputable people

40:09.060 --> 40:11.220
shall never cross the threshold
of the Rong Mansion.

40:11.220 --> 40:12.020
In my opinion,

40:12.470 --> 40:14.130
to be Lady Shanbao's husband,

40:14.470 --> 40:16.660
one must be a man of impeccable character,

40:16.660 --> 40:18.830
exceptional in both talent and appearance.

40:18.830 --> 40:20.220
A man of dubious origin

40:20.470 --> 40:21.910
and disreputable conduct,

40:21.910 --> 40:23.470
who already has a wife and children

40:23.470 --> 40:25.520
yet dares to falsely claim
he is unmarried,

40:25.520 --> 40:27.150
ought to be handed over to the authorities

40:27.150 --> 40:29.810
and charged with marriage fraud.

40:30.990 --> 40:32.310
What a pitiful sight!

40:32.830 --> 40:34.430
Just look at how she's weeping.

40:34.430 --> 40:36.590
It speaks of a life
of sorrow and misfortune.

40:36.590 --> 40:37.670
Don't worry.

40:38.390 --> 40:40.700
Lady Shanbao is fair-minded.

40:40.950 --> 40:43.010
She would never act for selfish gain.

40:43.030 --> 40:45.040
Knowing you've come all this way
with your children to find your husband,

40:45.040 --> 40:45.950
she could never be

40:45.950 --> 40:47.390
the one to break your family apart

40:47.390 --> 40:48.590
and sever those ties.

40:50.030 --> 40:51.510
-Mother.
-Mother.

40:51.950 --> 40:53.350
-Mother.
-Mother.

40:53.660 --> 40:54.100
-Mother.
-Mother.

40:54.100 --> 40:56.100
This woman does look pitiful.

40:56.100 --> 40:57.990
She has traveled so far
with her children to find her husband.

40:57.990 --> 40:59.620
This matter
must be properly resolved today.

40:59.620 --> 41:01.680
We must find a way to verify the truth.

41:01.700 --> 41:02.830
We cannot let outsiders say

41:02.830 --> 41:04.350
that you forcibly took
another woman's husband.

41:04.350 --> 41:04.950
If this affair

41:04.950 --> 41:06.610
reaches Grandmother's ears,

41:06.910 --> 41:07.470
he will never be

41:07.470 --> 41:09.130
allowed into the Rong family.

41:10.440 --> 41:12.400
Lady Shanbao, he is your man.

41:12.830 --> 41:14.430
However you settle this matter,

41:14.430 --> 41:16.230
there must be proper procedure.

41:22.350 --> 41:22.910
Ms. Luo.

41:23.610 --> 41:25.210
You claim he is your husband.

41:25.470 --> 41:26.730
What proof do you have?

41:27.260 --> 41:29.460
I'm a chaste woman with no one to rely on.

41:29.470 --> 41:33.000
Would I truly ruin my own reputation
to falsely accuse someone?

41:33.830 --> 41:35.630
If you refuse to acknowledge me,

41:35.790 --> 41:37.430
today I will just

41:37.430 --> 41:39.130
kill myself
before the gate of the Rong family,

41:39.130 --> 41:40.660
just to prove my innocence!

41:43.170 --> 41:43.580
Right!

41:44.110 --> 41:46.170
My husband has a red mole on his chest.

41:46.430 --> 41:47.490
What are you doing?

41:48.800 --> 41:49.530
How dare you!

41:53.060 --> 41:53.690
If I weren't

41:53.690 --> 41:55.370
his wife,

41:55.550 --> 41:57.210
how could I know such a detail?

41:57.830 --> 41:59.540
Lady Shanbao, if you don't believe me,

41:59.540 --> 42:01.830
a simple examination will prove the truth.

42:01.830 --> 42:03.290
If I have told a single lie,

42:03.350 --> 42:05.000
may I be struck by ten thousand arrows

42:05.000 --> 42:06.390
and die a terrible death!

42:06.390 --> 42:09.870
-Have him examined!
-Have him examined!

42:10.390 --> 42:11.530
We should have him examined.

42:11.530 --> 42:12.790
Better to have him examined.

42:12.790 --> 42:15.390
The truth will be known
after the examination.

42:15.430 --> 42:17.100
That woman is crying so bitterly.

42:17.100 --> 42:18.560
It surely cannot be an act.

42:19.030 --> 42:22.070
My man is not for outsiders to see.

42:23.460 --> 42:25.790
And he certainly won't undress in public.

42:28.740 --> 42:29.260
Jun Dai,

42:30.160 --> 42:32.160
you're Mr. Lu's personal attendant

42:32.210 --> 42:34.010
and a servant of the Rong family.

42:34.340 --> 42:35.000
You tell us.

42:36.460 --> 42:39.390
Lady Shanbao, I dare not speak.

42:39.880 --> 42:40.890
If you still hold back the truth,

42:40.890 --> 42:42.420
you'll be punished as well.

42:48.700 --> 42:50.100
I dare not hide anything.

42:51.740 --> 42:52.620
It's true.

42:53.910 --> 42:55.260
-It's true!
-It really is true!

42:55.260 --> 42:56.460
He seems like such a decent guy.

42:56.460 --> 42:57.030
Who would have thought?

42:57.030 --> 42:57.790
What more is there to say?

42:57.790 --> 42:58.870
It's settled.

42:58.950 --> 43:00.260
What sort of nonsense is this?

43:00.260 --> 43:01.220
I told you so.

43:05.180 --> 43:06.510
Just send him to the authorities.

43:06.510 --> 43:06.910
Lady Shanbao.

43:06.910 --> 43:07.770
Close the gate.

43:07.860 --> 43:08.660
Lady Shanbao!

43:11.350 --> 43:12.580
Lady Shanbao, I beg you to see the truth!

43:12.580 --> 43:13.990
Someone must have set a trap to frame me.

43:13.990 --> 43:15.390
You must allow me to defend myself!

43:15.390 --> 43:17.630
How dare you still lie through your teeth
and talk back?

43:17.630 --> 43:18.870
The only reason you haven't been
turned over to the authorities

43:18.870 --> 43:20.270
is Lady Shanbao's mercy.

43:20.870 --> 43:21.950
Get lost.

43:23.100 --> 43:24.100
What a scoundrel!

43:25.510 --> 43:27.260
Just days ago
he was parading around the streets.

43:27.260 --> 43:28.260
Now he's done for.

43:28.960 --> 43:30.190
-Mr. Lu.
-He deserves it!

43:30.190 --> 43:32.420
You are no longer welcome
in the Rong Mansion.

43:32.420 --> 43:34.650
Why not come home with me?

43:35.620 --> 43:37.580
We'll put our past grievances aside

43:37.580 --> 43:39.380
and make a fresh start together.

43:41.510 --> 43:42.990
-Father.
-Come back.

43:42.990 --> 43:44.470
Come home with us.

43:44.740 --> 43:46.700
-Father, come back.
-Father.

43:46.950 --> 43:48.870
Father, please come back.

43:48.870 --> 43:50.530
-Come back, Father.
-Father.

46:23.190 --> 46:25.620
[Bathing Products in the Ming Dynasty]

46:32.660 --> 46:33.390
Jasmine?

46:35.740 --> 46:37.580
And it even has musk in it.

46:38.540 --> 46:39.800
In this episode, Lu Jianglai

46:39.800 --> 46:41.030
was made to bathe with fragrant toiletries

46:41.030 --> 46:42.120
before meeting Rong Shanbao.

46:42.120 --> 46:43.350
Bathing products in the Ming Dynasty

46:43.350 --> 46:44.480
were quite diverse.

46:44.920 --> 46:46.450
Ordinary folks mostly used

46:46.710 --> 46:48.880
low-cost cleansers such as plant ash

46:48.880 --> 46:49.750
and soap pods.

46:50.150 --> 46:52.220
Officials, merchants and wealthy families

46:52.220 --> 46:53.900
opted for Feizhuzi and Yizi.

46:54.520 --> 46:55.350
Among them, Yizi

46:55.350 --> 46:55.960
already worked

46:55.960 --> 46:57.350
much like modern soap

46:57.450 --> 46:58.880
and was even made in scented varieties

46:58.880 --> 46:59.920
like sweet osmanthus and rose.

46:59.920 --> 47:01.680
[Bath Beans]

46:59.970 --> 47:01.400
However, due to high production costs,

47:01.400 --> 47:03.390
it was exclusive to the upper class.

47:03.390 --> 47:05.280
A formula for fragrant soap
recorded in an ancient book

47:05.280 --> 47:06.260
from the Ming Dynasty

47:06.260 --> 47:07.050
exemplified

47:07.150 --> 47:09.440
the sophisticated craftsmanship
of soap-making in that era.

47:09.440 --> 47:10.920
Blended with botanical fragrances,

47:10.920 --> 47:13.310
it served both cleansing
and perfuming functions.

47:13.310 --> 47:15.270
Would you like to try

47:15.270 --> 47:16.830
the same type of bath beans
used by Mr. Lu?
